    "title": "Surgical-Synthetic-Data-Generation-and-Segmentation",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.17284863",
    "publication_date": "2025-10-07",
    "description": "<p>This dataset contains synthetic, Generative AI enhanced and real images, with their labels, for Computer Vision in robotic surgery. It is part of ongoing research on sim-to-real applications in surgical robotics.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The paper including synthetic and real images has been published:&nbsp; \"A reproducible framework for synthetic data generation and instance segmentation in robotic suturing\", Journal: International Journal of Computer Assisted Radiology and Surgery, DOI: 10.1007/s11548-025-03460-8<br><br></li>\n<li>The paper including synthetic, TURBO-Enhanced, and real images is under review for publication</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For further information see the repository on GitHub: https://github.com/PietroLeoncini/Surgical-Synthetic-Data-Generation-and-Segmentation</p>",
